  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.46 - AM050 top-level ForPath redundant MapFrom cleanup\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM050 now reports redundant top-level ForPath MapFrom mappings when source and destination members match\n            - The safe rewrite action removes redundant top-level ForPath calls when only MapFrom is configured\n            - Nested ForPath destination paths remain outside AM050 because convention equivalence is not guaranteed\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (854 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - PR #121 CI/package smoke checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.45 - AM031 SequenceEqual and static LINQ enumeration tracking",
